454
00:39:03,502 --> 00:39:06,074
My baby.

455
00:39:06,074 --> 00:39:09,644
Why did you take her from us?

456
00:39:13,271 --> 00:39:20,525
Joyce, Joyce, Joyce...

457
00:39:22,081 --> 00:39:29,253
She's my baby.

458
00:39:29,253 --> 00:39:33,486
My baby, my child.

459
00:39:33,486 --> 00:39:37,127
Joyce, wherever you are,

460
00:39:38,924 --> 00:39:44,702
