when I become a star.

508
00:43:44,661 --> 00:43:48,097
I don't want to be away from them.

509
00:43:48,097 --> 00:43:51,782
And I will watch over you, too.

510
00:43:51,782 --> 00:43:55,675
You're not supposed to talk like that, Sep.

511
00:43:55,675 --> 00:43:58,689
It will take a long time for that to happen.

512
00:43:58,689 --> 00:44:03,794
And while we're still in this world...

513
00:44:04,880 --> 00:44:12,153
