515
00:45:00,518 --> 00:45:03,386
How dare you come here!

516
00:45:07,433 --> 00:45:09,434
How dare you!

517
00:45:13,364 --> 00:45:15,864
Ma'am, please.

518
00:45:15,864 --> 00:45:19,508
Let us see her, even for a while.

519
00:45:19,508 --> 00:45:23,625
