531
00:45:58,609 --> 00:46:01,612
You killed Joyce.

532
00:46:01,612 --> 00:46:03,669
You killed Joyce!

533
00:46:03,669 --> 00:46:05,649
If something happens to my daughter,

534
00:46:05,649 --> 00:46:09,544
