into doing that small-time movie!

536
00:46:17,763 --> 00:46:19,330
Joyce?

537
00:46:19,330 --> 00:46:22,661
Joyce, what happened? Why are you-

538
00:46:31,975 --> 00:46:33,741
What happened?

539
00:46:33,741 --> 00:46:35,976
