542
00:46:45,189 --> 00:46:48,859
I'm not sure
if this is still the life I'm dreaming of.

543
00:46:48,859 --> 00:46:50,060
I don't want it anymore.

544
00:46:50,060 --> 00:46:52,496
Joyce, Joyce.

545
00:46:52,496 --> 00:46:55,166
In the brief moment that I got to know you,

546
00:46:55,166 --> 00:46:57,634
when I was still courting you...

547
00:46:58,424 --> 00:47:03,662
I can say
that you're the strongest person I have met.

548
00:47:06,685 --> 00:47:08,886
Liam, please.

549
00:47:09,805 --> 00:47:15,130
Please, just this once, can I breathe?

550
00:47:20,858 --> 00:47:23,460
Run away with me.

551
00:47:24,695 --> 00:47:27,063
I'll go anywhere with you. I won't leave you.

552
00:47:30,901 --> 00:47:32,566
Thank you, Director! Thank you!

553
00:47:32,566 --> 00:47:33,834
Joyce...

554
00:47:36,340 --> 00:47:37,908
Joyce, where are you?

555
00:47:37,908 --> 00:47:39,376
Hey, Joyce! Joyce!

556
00:47:39,376 --> 00:47:40,711
Come back here!

557
00:47:40,711 --> 00:47:42,178
Joyce!

558
00:47:44,215 --> 00:47:46,953
You killed Joyce!

559
00:47:46,953 --> 00:47:49,321
You killed her!

560
00:47:50,366 --> 00:47:53,901
You killed my daughter!

561
00:47:53,901 --> 00:47:57,155
You killed my daughter!

562
00:48:07,038 --> 00:48:08,657
I dragged her into my mess!

563
00:48:08,657 --> 00:48:12,576
Joyce died carrying that in her chest.

564
00:48:12,576 --> 00:48:15,346
What do you mean, Uncle Edmond?
What did you tell Joyce?

565
00:48:15,346 --> 00:48:18,015
There's no one else to blame but me.

566
00:48:18,015 --> 00:48:20,885
If only I didn't go back to her life.

567
00:48:20,885 --> 00:48:23,118
This is my fault.

568
00:48:23,118 --> 00:48:24,989
What do I do with her cell phone?

569
00:48:24,989 --> 00:48:27,224
I don't know the password.

570
00:48:27,224 --> 00:48:30,094
- Can I borrow it, Auntie?
- How did you open it?

571
00:48:30,094 --> 00:48:32,951
She asked me to exchange passwords with her

572
00:48:32,953 --> 00:48:34,891
while she's still not returning my feelings.

573
00:48:34,891 --> 00:48:37,313
So we'll be assured that there's no one else.

574
00:48:37,315 --> 00:48:39,215
I love your daughter so much, Auntie.

575
00:48:39,216 --> 00:48:40,950
I'm recording myself

576
00:48:40,951 --> 00:48:45,186
in case something happens to me
because of the information I know.

577
00:48:45,187 --> 00:48:47,411
Hans, I know you have access to my phone.

578
00:48:47,411 --> 00:48:50,007
I know you can open this.
